; The Controls of unit-default-theme-gallery.tscn at `gui/theme/default_theme_scale` 1.5, the one
; variable. Each margin, corner and spacing of the default theme rounds from the scaled value. The
; other two theme-scale scenes hold no Button, MenuButton, MenuBar, LinkButton or ColorPickerButton,
; so neither draws the flat boxes that move at this scale.

